# What the demo's Comics and Books libraries hold. Fields are separated by
# `|`. Lines are read in order; the seed lays everything out again whenever
# this file changes.
#
#   corpus|<path in the corpus>|<path in the libraries>
#   file|<sha256>|<path in the libraries>|<url>
#   picturebook|<id>|<title>|<writer>|<illustrator>|<designer>|<editor>|<web page>
#   page|<id>|<sha256>|<url>     a picture book's pages, in reading order
#   logo|<sha256>|<url>          the Book Dash logo for the credits pages
#
# Downloads are checked against their SHA-256 and kept by it, first from
# $CORPUS_URL/demo-library/<sha256> and otherwise from the upstream URL, so
# a file that changes upstream is still found once it's mirrored there. A
# folder becomes a series, and a file at a library's root is a series named
# after the file, so those files are named by title.
# Sources and licenses are in CREDITS.md beside this file.

